    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:302278282ace7d87d67e659d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "必ず寝る前に尻尾をケアするのさ。\r\n私がエレガンテでいる限り、\r\n音は微笑んでくれるからね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ece42821156e4cc12046a83599c08b15830ab4b0735ab747c33f641bca3d8a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "90004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/90004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:274314b1ba13224739306ca4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "しーっ…今はカルマートに、ね？\r\n夜風に揺れる木々のコーロを、\r\nゆっくり楽しもうじゃないか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56977b539aa36620f48d944a4d37772d4072f880fd1e45debc8d3dbd3a300eb5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "90005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/90005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfd884525e54da01f4827253",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "アスファルトを貫くツクシ、\r\nなんてディナミコな息吹なんだ。\r\n賛美の音色を奏でよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a59af609cbd64f835dbde9a39d8ff52338d4e9bb0e6a79c025dd782ad2f9c2c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "90006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/90006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6acf499438017044fce4c4b5",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "おっと、真夏の太陽かと思えば――\r\n君のパッショナートな瞳で、\r\n身も心も焼かれてしまいそうだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed36bc03563b5d0ecdacdeb2ba8c4ee65d1b329d5c3d201ac52b0c3ef55e2f49",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "90007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/90007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:616c6fb91ef8973e13f9d1f9",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秋は楽器の宝箱さ。\r\nさあ、落ち葉の道を行き、\r\nセッションとしゃれこもう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a0097fd6e886526fb6b8de79dec07d0412e88ec371b5ad018430759d6d7a185",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "90008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/90008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e83f6d50694b6784d4a758bb",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "冷たそうな君の手を放って\r\nおくなんて、私にはできないよ。\r\nおいで…温めてあげる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a593212c70129448a21c7d9a7e87a542baf251e51d9d57b9ad0180d29fe53b3d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "90009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/90009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9a9e5c7ab312dcc72df0b6a",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ブオン・サン・バレンティーノ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc1e7888a46a7e643da26b24b27a6209a5130b57334e4d4cebdbc091fe94c4ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "90020"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/90020"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a687d4afaaee3c2830d771b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ソイヤソイヤ、ソイヤソイヤッ！！\r\nっと、これがキタサンの音色――\r\n速さの秘訣さ。モノにしたいね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f34bdbca89ba19cd06bba53609ecc4a92dd0d5a979db85d14a6696ba01de57e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/91000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfcc5891cacd9108a5e8399b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "高尚总是远远地，\r\n害羞地听着我的演奏呢。\r\n呵呵，可爱得让人受不了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8239b28fff65599874207541f78e8eba10fc7676abb0998a076bd9655ab56abe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/91001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd692d55e45d98a098882462",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ダイヤとの散歩は心が躍る。\r\n変わった雑貨屋に怪しい路地…\r\nなんて愉快なノータとの出会い！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cba6aee68c645f9452914d24146fcb22c58c4dfac4e13d3a261203a454648c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/91002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4db44e8c4828d5be5df3877e",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ああ…あああぁ～～！！\r\nお寿司、ワサビ抜きで頼んだのに！\r\nツーンが取れないよ、ツーンが！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f68b4e91f6e3dd9483c22dbbba57ed96d6ae679f91ab4b0bc25516c0233ea49f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/91003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f6fe1fc0f62efdcaebda0da",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "家に帰れば家族と即セッション。\r\nご近所さんも巻き込んで、\r\n日が暮れるまでアンサンブルさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c32a719a8581b842c67e2dfc95701882cb015487b2c37f041f2047f5f10859a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91004"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/91004"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1232478633ef31214c660f2",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ライブは生き物。\r\n時に五線譜を飛び出して、\r\n無限の音と戯れるのさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97d4c7584ebd98713bee550ba5e3657616cc3148ac09d2a8b06a918262ad92d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91005"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/91005"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:709ba8404cc73064564b639c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "同じ楽曲でも、表情はその時々。\r\n何度も奏で、語り合う。\r\nそうして魂に刻まれるのさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "80e7993a1ad598c5baaba6b296cef2e07ae5d29912e73627f5dd21abceb650ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91006"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/91006"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbaec69ab5cd23d59ff7bbbb",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "このブローチには、愛すべき\r\nムジカの源をあしらっている。\r\n彩り豊かな星…地球さ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5776f3d4ab2b1fa32c5204a97cfac1a555ea6f25f97fab98a6b9df73180c36c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91007"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/91007"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:160d92d1a96d00bafb101d1b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ターフに立つときは、いつだって\r\nこのスコアと同じ気分さ。\r\nタタタタラタタンタターーーン♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "638f23fccbff9f5764fdbbec9568cfd8b36690165c57b06c7abc8284795ec946",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91008"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/91008"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d48099a788bf9151099be8dc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "私も楽器の一部だからね。\r\n牛乳、指の体操、そして唇の\r\nフラッピングで1日を始めるのさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a413b5f09fe01234c8c873d909a7453491746b4def2727e9606788ff1a3f795b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91009"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/91009"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9c44c17405477b1224a358b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "朗らかな午後のひと時に、\r\nアダージョな演奏会でもどうかな？\r\n君だけに贈る…特別公演だよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b8fcf3654f86c0100c9bff35a5942018fc449df8c2ae7895d520355ddeef520",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91010"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/91010"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af586dc59b4b5fee7358e2fc",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "もうこんな時間か。まだまだ\r\n君の音と触れ合いたかったけど…\r\n続きは夢の中だね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7ccb3696f41d8d3a3431794128289a32ede62fbaac2a15f1f884ffbd8153035",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91011"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/91011"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13833646357f425c6cacd9cd",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "緊張している新入生たちに向けて、\r\n演奏会を開くつもりさ。音楽は、\r\n心のドアをノックする魔法だよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "412042e6ccadd8f09afc3d2adc3320ba195cd6744b8857735c3cdfb64bd4de13",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91012"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/91012"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35ba916bec19e07b45a7768d",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "ヴァイオリンは乾燥に弱くてね。\r\nエアコンは厳禁、加湿器はオン。\r\n音色のご機嫌取りは繊細なのさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fca0745f15ed8c961de7cc5eb92cb81a996d9fda3562a3cace16a9015adc940",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91013"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/91013"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c92baee6ddabd474721181be",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "秋は物悲しい季節だって？\r\nふふっ、私が側にいても、\r\n同じセリフを言えるかな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b97c7ec4bb78e765e803ca589b8a9b5061ffff2a5c5b1c1aac5f377fa435dedf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91014"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/91014"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c1461fb340cc96d4f7c71d5",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "木枯らしが撫でる度、私の心が\r\nコン・エスプレッシオーネに…。\r\nああ、なんて刺激的な季節なんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f584da984149e736768be84cfe4a851b86a1a03e1684d3b9e17cec7849d6890e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91015"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/91015"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b80a04c8e87ee92c8569f2f4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "トレーニングを始める前に、\r\n音合わせから始めようか。\r\nラ～～～～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ede7ef3ce9c93835db2acb184c1409a5398f9bb09d571d8f58078eb9a5f50df",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "92000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/92000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23747e2b9e9316e526767ee4",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "さあ、奏でよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f494497f99c17f0251afb3f2bb6b4c3c81de76f1c0134fc4e7649202f933979",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "920000"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/920000"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71bf42a3fb0715f420968575",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "調律に励めば、アポロンは微笑む。\r\nレースも同じ――鍛錬に励む者に、\r\n女神は微笑む！さあ、やろう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4ffddb592c5422db837c2bb4b1e794aa577159016a21778a3e6d1588707090b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "92001"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/92001"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6465741935057b1e2f779fe",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "休むも励むもアド・リビトゥム。\r\n思うがまま進もう。\r\nどの道も、ムジカへ至るのさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1adea821edcc5d8e736754a8849d076c65579ccf19159c40808058dfe5415ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "92002"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/92002"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:449277281cf9c0ea4e3b3f3c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "トレーニングとは挑戦の連続。\r\nア・ポコでいい――どんな\r\nエチュードでも始めてみよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8aee7f72b556ad5ac5c00d412b3b3befc908c02e6a3f49f13983f1157e26fc20",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "92003"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/1102/92003"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76135d65f4a06926a85c1a8c",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "エチュードを重ね、\r\n私たちのリズムは揃ってきた。\r\n2人の音が溶け合う日も近そうだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59243e36d5b6a824569f020c77e46b58febdc7442865c2208fbb8db385b287ca",
